[
  {
    "id": "draft-c07-03",
    "kind": "mathematics_or_missing_proof",
    "field": "scene_spec.steps[2]",
    "before": "第三步:换元(逐项):$u=2\\theta$,则 $du=2\\,d\\theta$,即 $d\\theta=\\frac12du$;上下限:$\\theta=-\\frac\\pi4\\to u=-\\frac\\pi2$,$\\theta=\\frac\\pi4\\to u=\\frac\\pi2$;故 $\\int\\cos^2(2\\theta)d\\theta=\\frac12\\int_{-\\frac\\pi2}^{\\frac\\pi2}\\cos^2u\\,du$。",
    "after": "第三步：换元 $u=2\\theta$，$d\\theta=\\frac{1}{2}du$；上下限分别变为 $-\\frac{\\pi}{2}$、$\\frac{\\pi}{2}$。逐项写出 $\\int_{-\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}\\cos^2(2\\theta)\\,d\\theta=\\frac{1}{2}\\int_{-\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\cos^2u\\,du$；高亮两端均为定积分。",
    "reason": "restore both limits; indefinite integral cannot equal a definite value"
  },
  {
    "id": "draft-c10-05",
    "kind": "mathematics_or_missing_proof",
    "field": "scene_spec.steps[2]",
    "before": "第三步:交叉序(关键点):$S_{2m}\\le S_{2m+1}\\le S_{2l+1}$ 对一切 $m,l$ 成立(偶部分和总不超奇部分和);两序列单调有界 → 各有极限;差 $S_{2N+1}-S_{2N}=a_{2N+1}\\to0$(逐项),故两极限相同,记为 $S$。",
    "after": "第三步：高亮真正的交叉序 $S_{2m}\\le S_{2l+1}$，对任意 $m,l\\ge0$ 成立。若 $m\\le l$，由偶子列递增得 $S_{2m}\\le S_{2l}\\le S_{2l+1}$；若 $m>l$，由奇子列递减得 $S_{2m}\\le S_{2m+1}\\le S_{2l+1}$。因此 $0=S_0\\le S_{2m}\\le S_1$，两子列单调有界；$S_{2N+1}-S_{2N}=a_{2N+1}\\to0$，故两极限相同，记为 $S$。",
    "reason": "old odd-to-odd inequality was false for arbitrary indices; case split repairs ordering"
  },
  {
    "id": "draft-c20-04",
    "kind": "mathematics_or_missing_proof",
    "field": "scene_spec.steps[3]",
    "before": "第四步:写 $x=c+h$,$n\\cdot h=0$;交叉项 $2c^{\\mathsf T}Wh=2t\\cdot n^{\\mathsf T}h=0$ 消失;截面满足 $h^{\\mathsf T}Wh=1-\\frac{6t^2}{11}$;故 $|t|>\\sqrt{\\frac{11}6}$ 为空,等号为单点,小于时为椭圆。",
    "after": "第四步：写 $x=c+h$，$n^{\\mathsf T}h=0$。先逐分量算 $Wc=\\frac{t}{11}(6,6,6)^{\\mathsf T}=\\frac{6t}{11}n$，于是 $2c^{\\mathsf T}Wh=2(Wc)^{\\mathsf T}h=\\frac{12t}{11}n^{\\mathsf T}h=0$。截面满足 $h^{\\mathsf T}Wh=1-\\frac{6t^2}{11}$；$|t|>\\sqrt{\\frac{11}{6}}$ 时空集，等号时仅为 $c$，严格小于时为椭圆。",
    "reason": "missing 6/11 factor in Wc"
  },
  {
    "id": "draft-c20-04",
    "kind": "missing_proof",
    "field": "scene_spec.steps[5]",
    "before": null,
    "after": "第六步：高亮限制矩阵的特征方程 $\\left(\\lambda-\\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\left(\\lambda-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)-\\frac{1}{12}=\\lambda^2-4\\lambda+\\frac{11}{3}=(\\lambda-2)^2-\\frac{1}{3}=0$。故特征值为 $2\\pm\\frac{1}{\\sqrt3}$；在正交特征坐标中逐轴用 $\\lambda_j u_j^2=1-\\frac{6t^2}{11}$ 求半轴，无小数估算。",
    "reason": "show exact roots rather than announce them"
  },
  {
    "id": "draft-c34-05",
    "kind": "mathematics_or_missing_proof",
    "field": "scene_spec.steps[1]",
    "before": "第二步:逐因子相乘(逐步,高亮):$(I+ae_{12})(I+be_{23})=I+ae_{12}+be_{23}+abe_{13}$;再乘 $(I-ae_{12})$:结果 $=I+ae_{12}+be_{23}+abe_{13}-ae_{12}-a^2e_{12}^2-abe_{12}e_{23}-a^2be_{13}e_{12}=I+be_{23}+abe_{13}$(用 $e_{12}^2=0$、$e_{13}e_{12}=0$ 消去)。",
    "after": "第二步：逐因子相乘：$(I+ae_{12})(I+be_{23})=I+ae_{12}+be_{23}+abe_{13}$。右乘 $(I-ae_{12})$ 时保持次序：$I+ae_{12}+be_{23}+abe_{13}-ae_{12}-a^2e_{12}^2-ab e_{23}e_{12}-a^2b e_{13}e_{12}=I+be_{23}+abe_{13}$。高亮 $e_{23}e_{12}=0$，不能误写为 $e_{12}e_{23}=e_{13}$。",
    "reason": "noncommuting multiplication order was reversed"
  },
  {
    "id": "draft-c48-04",
    "kind": "mathematics_or_missing_proof",
    "field": "scene_spec.steps[4]",
    "before": "第五步:验证(逐步):$a=\\frac94$ 时 $aX-Y\\sim N(\\frac94-2,\\frac{81}4\\cdot4+9)=N(\\frac14,\\frac{117}4)$;其余 $a$ 协方差非零,不独立(高亮结论)。",
    "after": "第五步：$a=\\frac{9}{4}$ 时先高亮平方 $a^2=\\frac{81}{16}$；均值为 $aEX-EY=\\frac{9}{4}-2=\\frac{1}{4}$，方差为 $a^2\\operatorname{Var}X+\\operatorname{Var}Y=\\frac{81}{16}\\cdot4+9=\\frac{81}{4}+\\frac{36}{4}=\\frac{117}{4}$。故 $aX-Y\\sim N\\left(\\frac{1}{4},\\frac{117}{4}\\right)$；与 $S$ 联合正态且协方差为零，因而独立。其余 $a$ 的协方差非零，不独立。",
    "reason": "a squared was 81/16, not 81/4"
  },
  {
    "id": "draft-c49-05",
    "kind": "mathematics_or_missing_proof",
    "field": "scene_spec.steps[3]",
    "before": "第四步:三项控制(关键点,高亮):(i) 尾部概率(Markov):$P(\\exists i:|X_i|>M)\\le nP(|X_1|>M)\\le\\frac{n\\tau_M}M$;(ii) 截断偏差 $|E\\overline X_n-E\\overline Y_n^{(M)}|\\le\\tau_M$;(iii) 切比雪夫:$P(|\\overline Y_n^{(M)}-E\\overline Y_n^{(M)}|\\ge\\varepsilon)\\le\\frac{M^2}{n\\varepsilon^2}$。",
    "after": "第四步：对任意 $\\varepsilon>0$，先选足够大的固定 $M$ 使 $\\tau_M<\\frac{\\varepsilon}{3}$。三角不等式把误差分为平均尾部、截断均值波动、确定性偏差；后者小于 $\\frac{\\varepsilon}{3}$。对平均尾部用 Markov：$P\\left(|\\overline X_n-\\overline Y_n^{(M)}|\\ge\\frac{\\varepsilon}{3}\\right)\\le\\frac{3\\tau_M}{\\varepsilon}$。对截断均值用切比雪夫：$P\\left(|\\overline Y_n^{(M)}-EY_1^{(M)}|\\ge\\frac{\\varepsilon}{3}\\right)\\le\\frac{9M^2}{n\\varepsilon^2}$。故 $P(|\\overline X_n-\\mu|\\ge\\varepsilon)\\le\\frac{3\\tau_M}{\\varepsilon}+\\frac{9M^2}{n\\varepsilon^2}$。",
    "reason": "union bound for existence of a large individual term cannot control average or vanish at fixed M"
  },
  {
    "id": "draft-c49-05",
    "kind": "mathematics_or_missing_proof",
    "field": "scene_spec.steps[4]",
    "before": "第五步:取极限次序(关键点,高亮):先令 $n\\to\\infty$(切比雪夫项与尾部项趋于零),再令 $M\\to\\infty$($\\tau_M\\to0$);次序不可交换;结论:$E|X_1|<\\infty$ 的独立同分布样本满足 $\\overline X_n\\xrightarrow P\\mu$,无需有限方差。",
    "after": "第五步：高亮极限次序。对每个满足偏差条件的固定 $M$，先令 $n\\to\\infty$ 得 $\\limsup_{n\\to\\infty}P(|\\overline X_n-\\mu|\\ge\\varepsilon)\\le\\frac{3\\tau_M}{\\varepsilon}$；再令 $M\\to\\infty$，由 $\\tau_M\\to0$ 得上界为零。于是 $\\overline X_n\\xrightarrow{P}\\mu$；全程仅用 $E|X_1|<\\infty$，没有假设原变量方差有限。",
    "reason": "correct limit order and uniform averaged-tail control"
  },
